<title>SPAIN: Spain sees good relations with new French cabinet.</title>
<headline>Spain sees good relations with new French cabinet.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Monday he expected to have the same degree of cooperation with the new French government on Europe's single currency as with the previous.</p>
<p>&quot;I am sure we can work with the new French government as we did with the previous one, in the definition of a policy of European integration that gives macroeconomic stability to Europe and also gives us a strong and stable currency,&quot; he told journalists on the fringes of a business seminar.</p>
</text>
